# What Is Phishing?

## Definition
The use of deceptive message to get user credential and to steal.

## How It Works
(Attacker pretends to be a trusted source → victim acts → attacker gains access)

## Why Attackers Use It
- Cheap and easy
- Targets people, not systems
- High success rate

## Common Goals
- Steal login credentials
- Steal money or card details
- Install malware

## Key Takeaway
recognise warning signs,look out for urgent matters
